--[[
        SHADOW -- your own shadow walks your steps a few seconds behind you: do not stop

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/Shadow"))()

        "Don't stop moving." A black copy of you (your own character, all black, a dark red edge) comes out where you
        were 4 seconds ago and does everything you did, exactly as you did it (your walk, your jumps, your turns), 4
        seconds later. Keep moving and it never reaches you; stand still and in 4 seconds it is where you are: your
        death. It gets closer as time goes (from 4 seconds behind to 2.5). Your heart beats when it is near. Hide and it
        loses you: it fades, and comes back out where you are once you are out again, 4 seconds later. After 45 seconds
        it fades away for good.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes).
]]

